## Files derived from rich

The following files in `rich/` are modified versions of upstream rich 14.1.0
sources. See `patches/0001-optional-deps.patch` for the exact changes.

| File | Change |
|---|---|
| `rich/syntax.py` | Pygments imports made lazy; ANSI theme fallback added |
| `rich/traceback.py` | Pygments imports made lazy; theme table keyed by tuples |
| `rich/markdown.py` | markdown-it-py imported at construction; actionable error |

The following file is new and original to this repository:

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `rich/_syntax_themes.py` | ANSI theme tables keyed by plain tuples, derived from the theme tables that upstream ships inside `rich/syntax.py` |

`tests/test_optional_deps.py`, `tools/*.py`, and `assets/make_cover.py` are
original to this repository.
